OL,3,ASuitcase Richard Burton sent Elizabeth
OL,4,ATaylor's clothes to sister in up for
OL,5,Aauction
OL,6,
OL,7,FA suitcase once containing Elizabeth
OL,8,FTaylor's unwanted clothes which was
OL,9,Fshipped by Richard Burton to his sister
OL,10,Fsuggesting to give them to "old
OL,11,Fcolliers" is up for auction.
OL,13,FBurton, from Pontrhydyfen in Neath Port
OL,14,FTalbot, wrote to his sister Hilda from
OL,15,FSwitzerland saying "don't pass out but
OL,16,Fthis is from me" as he sent her the
OL,17,Fclothes in 1971.
